CountdownCategory<public><localizes>:message = "Countdown"
CountdownDurationToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "Seconds to count (fractions allowed; 0.5 is half a second). At 0 the 'countdown finished' condition is satisfied. For a different length this once, pass the seconds to Restart from code."
CountdownStartOnActivatedToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "When on, restarts from the beginning on the activation signal (in a game sequence, when this node is entered) (even while counting) and stops on the deactivation signal. When off, ignores the activation signal (drive it with Start / Restart / Stop from code or with 'Start on begin' below)."
CountdownStartOnBeginToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "When on, starts counting at the start of the game (start of the simulation). Use it when the game flow is not used."
CountdownAlsoSendUpToolTip<public><localizes>:message = "When on, also sends the remaining-seconds and finished notifications to the ancestors (upward from the parent) in addition to the descendants. Use it to receive them in a HUD outside the node or in ancestor parts."
